          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.106,
            0.874,
            0.125
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• This new vertical line is "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "perpendicular",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " to the previous horizontal lines."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.129,
            0.849,
            0.148
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Yes, we can find a fold that creates a line parallel to the diagonal line."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.165,
            0.25,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Page No. 112"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.195,
            0.536,
            0.213
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here is another activity for you to try.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.224,
            0.833,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take a square sheet of paper, fold it in the middle and unfold it.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.246,
            0.754,
            0.264
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fold the edges towards the centre line and unfold them.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.268,
            0.881,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fold the top right and bottom left corners onto the creased line to create triangles. Refer to Fig. 5.8.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.313,
            0.66,
            0.331
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The triangles should not cross the crease lines.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.336,
            0.856,
            0.355
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Are a, b and c parallel to p, q and r respectively? Why or why not?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.411,
            0.367,
            0.606,
            0.583
          ],
          "content": [
